","time":"09:00","w":10120,"n":47,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/04/dycom-dy-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[1,0,1,1.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[1,0,1,1.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}]},"move":{"r1":-0.0407,"r5":-0.1004,"r20":-0.1603,"r1_spy":-0.0478,"r5_spy":-0.0958,"r20_spy":-0.1162}}],"quotes":[{"c":"DY 2018 Q3","e":"dy","d":"2018-11-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Noelle Dilts","x":"If so, how is the industry -- is the industry absorbing and customers, are they willing to absorb price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/20/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q3-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2018 Q3","e":"dy","d":"2018-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Fritzsche","x":"Steve, how much of your time is spent kind of looking for ways to, I don't know, automate the business into cliche (ph), but for ways to streamline your costs and just like thinking ahead in terms of different cost initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/20/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q3-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2018 Q3","e":"dy","d":"2018-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nielsen","x":"So we're taking cost out of our recruiting process and we think we're an attractive employer for people to come to work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/20/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q3-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2018 Q4","e":"dy","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nielsen","x":"That doesn't mean that we're not working hard to take cost out of the business and deploy new ways of managing the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q4-2019-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2019 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2019-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Rygiel","x":"And then, as it relates to rural fiber and FirstNet, can you talk about where we stand on both of those developments and how they're passed through your P&L?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/21/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2019 Q2","e":"dy","d":"2019-08-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nielsen","x":"Their payments in, as they are undergoing restructuring are quite good and we are encouraged that not only are they paying well, but they are also investing in their business, deploying more fiber had a good subscriber not only quarter, but expect to grow broadband subscribers for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/28/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2019 Q2","e":"dy","d":"2019-08-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nielsen","x":"We still have work to do on the processes and we're spending lots of time and attention to pull the cost out associated with those evolutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/28/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2019 Q3","e":"dy","d":"2019-11-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nielsen","x":"…on an industry report that just came out was that the average subscriber was using about 275 gig of data a month versus 230 gig a year ago, but if they were cord cutters, so in other words that they were not getting a linear video product and were using streaming services, it was over 500 gig.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2019 Q3","e":"dy","d":"2019-11-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Steven E. Nielsen","x":"And so there has been lots of research, lots of commentary by a number of industry participants about how this video ecosystem evolves from primarily linear delivered video, which is very efficient, to streaming video, which is very data intensive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2020 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2020-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Steven E. Nielsen","x":"So if you look at the headcount reduction of call it just north of 900 employees sequentially, about a one-third of those were non-revenue producing positions, we've had a number of efficiency initiatives under way, we took a hard look given the uncertainty on what we needed on the G&A side and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/19/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"DY 2020 Q2","e":"dy","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"H. Andrew DeFerrari","x":"Next, our operating leverage continued to improve as a result of the headcount reductions we initiated at the onset of the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"DY 2021 Q2","e":"dy","d":"2021-09-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Eric Luebchow","x":"…you talk through like any contractual provisions you have with your customers to kind of help pass through some of those higher labor expenses and kind of what impact that could have on your margins if you've seen of that yet or if there's any implied in your guidance for the October quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/01/dycom-industries-inc-dy-q2-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"DY 2026 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2025-05-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Peyovich","x":"Opportunities to build long haul and middle mile routes to meet the needs of AI infrastructure are increasing, and we are underway and executing well on the Lumen Overvolt project.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/21/dycom-dy-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DY 2026 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2025-05-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Peyovich","x":"All the hyperscalers reiterated or increased their CapEx budget and commitment to AI infrastructure on their most recent calls, and we continue to see these long haul and middle mile networks as a significant addressable market over the long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/21/dycom-dy-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DY 2026 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2025-05-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Daniel Peyovich","x":"…they need done, favors Dycom Industries, Inc. Transitioning to the broader economy, while recent tariff and international trade actions have created volatility and market uncertainty, we believe that the impact to Dycom Industries, Inc. and to our customers' current build plans will be…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/21/dycom-dy-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DY 2026 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2025-05-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Daniel Peyovich","x":"Since labor represents the majority of build costs, tariff implications are diluted as a percentage of the overall build, and as such, we are not anticipating an impact to our current build.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/21/dycom-dy-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DY 2026 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2025-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Drew DeFerrari","x":"So at times, we're investing in the business and it doesn't drop through, and other times, we're able to pass that through down to the bottom line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/21/dycom-dy-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DY 2026 Q1","e":"dy","d":"2025-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Laura Mayer","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/ca